---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="FAQ — Event Horizon">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
      <h1>Questions before crossing.</h1>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section compact">
    <div class="container grid-2">
      <div class="card"><h3>Do I need a launched product?</h3><p>No. But you need a clear target user, a concrete next milestone, and willingness to update publicly.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Is this a fundraising platform?</h3><p>No. Event Horizon provides authorized product information and investor briefings, not investment advice or financing guarantees.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>What gets more exposure?</h3><p>Projects with recent updates, real user signals, clear asks, and responsible disclosure get stronger placement.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Can sensitive details stay private?</h3><p>Yes. The content model supports public, community-only, and investor-only visibility as the platform matures.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
